OL,5,G1030 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FJames hosts the week's final visit
OL,7,     Fat Ivy House in St Austell. His
OL,8,     Fguests marvel at the delightful
OL,9,     Fviews, but the lack of a lock and
OL,10,     Fa substandard sausage put James
OL,11,     Funder scrutiny.
OL,12,G1105 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe B&Bers meet on payment day to
OL,14,     Fsettle some scores. Sleep troubles
OL,15,     Fand breakfast bugbears are on the
OL,16,     Fagenda, before the payments are
OL,17,     Frevealed and the winner is
OL,18,     Fannounced.
